@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Get court details (shared by both business tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courts/B01

### 2. Check availability before creating the example booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/availability?court_id=B01&date=2026-11-05&start_time=18:00&end_time=19:00

### 3. Create a booking: 201 on fresh data; repeating it gives 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "U1",
  "court_id": "B01",
  "date": "2026-11-05",
  "start_time": "18:00",
  "end_time": "19:00"
}

### 4. View the mock user's bookings; use the court_id to look up location
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?user_id=U1

### Invalid input: 422; must not create a booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "U1",
  "court_id": "B01",
  "date": "2026-11-05",
  "start_time": "18:00",
  "end_time": "17:00"
}
